# 9. Security and permissions

Because your coworkers will use this system, security is essential.

| Action            | Employee | Manager | Admin |
| ----------------- | -------- | ------- | ----- |
| Create activity   | Yes      | Yes     | Yes   |
| Upload photos     | Yes      | Yes     | Yes   |
| Edit own draft    | Yes      | Yes     | Yes   |
| View own reports  | Yes      | Yes     | Yes   |
| View team reports | No       | Yes     | Yes   |
| Approve reports   | No       | Yes     | Yes   |
| Manage employees  | No       | No      | Yes   |
| Change user roles | No       | No      | Yes   |
| Configure system  | No       | No      | Yes   |

Set up Firestore Security Rules to enforce these permissions on the server side, not just by hiding buttons in the frontend.&#x20;

